   "@type": "prov:Activity",
   "rdfs:label": "wikidata-brands",
   "dct:description": "Adds Wikidata facts (label, website, parent organisation, number of located items) to the NSI brand QIDs, and lists the items within 1 km of One Canada Square with any brand, owner, parent or operator link to an NSI brand.",
   "prov:used": [
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/brands-uk.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/wikidata",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://qlever.dev/api/wikidata",
     "dct:description": "SPARQL by VALUES (400 QIDs a query): English label, P856 websites, P749 parents with labels; count of items with P1716 = the brand and a P625"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/wikidata",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://qlever.dev/api/wikidata",
     "dct:description": "SPARQL spatialSearch (s2, 1000 m) around POINT(-0.0195 51.5049) over P625; then labels, P31 labels and P1716, P127, P749, P137 links of those items"
    },
    {
     "cwp:pathPattern": "data/raw/registry/qlever/<sha1>.json"
    }
   ],
   "prov:generated": [
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/wikidata-brands.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/wikidata-near.json"
    },
    {
     "cwp:pathPattern": "data/raw/registry/qlever/<sha1>.json"
    }
   ],
   "cwp:tool": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/tools/wikidata-brands.mjs"
   },
   "cwp:command": "NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY=1 node magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/tools/wikidata-brands.mjs",
   "cwp:kind": "fetch",
   "cwp:rule": [
    "nsi_brand_links: P1716, P127, P749 or P137 links whose target is an NSI UK brand QID.",
    "Cache: each raw QLever answer is stored under the first 16 hex digits of the SHA-1 of the query in data/raw/registry/qlever/ and read back when present; delete a file to ask again.",
    "Network: 0.7 s pause after each new query; no retry; User-Agent glitchcan-cwplans/0.1. Distances in metres, rounded to whole metres."
   ],
   "cwp:network": true,
   "cwp:deterministic": false,
   "cwp:after": [
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#activity/build-uk-brands"
    }
   ],
   "cwp:area": "brands",
   "cwp:fault": []
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#activity/match-osm",
   "@type": "prov:Activity",
   "rdfs:label": "match-osm",
   "dct:description": "Reads the OSM business features of the Canary Wharf box (osm-scan) and keeps those that are branches of a brand: by the feature's brand:wikidata, by the NSI Matcher on its names under its own key=value at its position, or by a brand tag that NSI does not list; street furniture is counted apart.",
   "prov:used": [
    {
     "@id": "urn:cwplans:local:data/raw/registry/osm-box-features.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/brands-uk.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "urn:cwplans:local:data/raw/registry/nsi/node_modules/name-suggestion-index/dist/json/nsi.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "urn:cwplans:local:data/raw/registry/nsi/node_modules/name-suggestion-index/dist/json/featureCollection.json"
    }
   ],
   "prov:generated": [
    {
     "@id": "urn:cwplans:local:data/raw/registry/osm-branches.json"
    }
   ],
   "cwp:tool": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/tools/match-osm.mjs"
   },
   "cwp:command": "node magpie/cwplans/registry/sources/brands/tools/match-osm.mjs",
   "cwp:kind": "join",
   "cwp:rule": [
    "A business feature is a branch when (1) its brand:wikidata is an NSI UK brand QID, or (2) the NSI Matcher matches its name, brand, name:en or official_name under its own key=value at its position, or (3) it has brand or brand:wikidata that NSI does not list.",
    "For a QID with several NSI items, the item whose key=value agrees with the feature is preferred.",
    "Disused features and opening_hours=closed are skipped.",
    "Street furniture (post boxes, ATMs, bicycle rental, lockers, vending machines and similar) is counted apart, not as branches.",
    "Name fields are tried in the order name, brand, name:en, official_name; the first NSI hit with match \"primary\" wins, else the first hit of any kind (alternate hits are accepted here, unlike the FSA match).",
    "The NSI Matcher is asked at the feature's own position (lon, lat), not at a fixed point.",
    "A conflict between the OSM brand:wikidata and the NSI QID is kept and flagged (qid_conflict); fhrs:id, addr:*, level, level:ref and website are carried for the later joins.",
    "Named businesses that match no brand are listed apart (unmatched_named_business), not dropped silently."
   ],
   "cwp:network": false,
   "cwp:deterministic": false,
   "cwp:after": [
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#activity/osm-scan"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#activity/build-uk-brands"
    }
   ],
   "cwp:area": "brands",
   "cwp:fault": []
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#activity/match-fsa-fetch",
   "@type": "prov:Activity",
   "rdfs:label": "match-fsa-fetch",
