     "dct:description": "robots.txt once per host, then one GET per URL with redirects followed by hand (robots.txt checked on each new host), User-Agent glitchcan-cwplans/0.1, one request at a time per host at least 1.5 s apart, at most 4 hosts at once, 20 s timeout, up to 4 tries with backoff on 429, 5xx, timeouts and resets"
    },
