   "rdfs:label": "render-structured-data",
   "dct:description": "Renders every web page the registry links to in headless Chromium and extracts from the rendered DOM: every JSON-LD script text as found, microdata (WHATWG algorithm) as JSON, and RDFa 1.1 as N-Triples. The same extractor runs over the server HTML of the same visit with scripts off, to mark blocks that only scripts made. For chain branches with no store page, searches the brand's store finder with the branch postcode and renders the branch page it links to.",
   "prov:used": [
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/registry/buildings.json"
