     "dct:description": "GET a ZIP per product, year and tile: lidar_tiles_dsm 1999 (2 m), 2003 (1 m), 2007 (0.5 m), 2012 (1 m and 0.5 m), 2015 (1 m); national_lidar_programme_dsm 2018 and 2020 (1 m); lidar_composite_first_return_dsm 2022 (1 m); tiles TQ3575 and TQ3580"
    }
   ],
   "prov:generated": [
    {
     "cwp:pathPattern": "data/raw/dsm/<product>-<year>-<res>-<tile>.zip"
