   "cwp:fault": [],
   "cwp:judgement": "JUDGEMENT in tools/build-towers.py: the primary survey per tower (2018 for Novotel cwb-0701 and Dollar Bay cwb-0737), levels added by hand (Pan Peninsula cwb-0801: 6.5 and 21.5 m read off the height histogram), a ground level for the height check (8 Canada Square cwb-0417: 9.7 m OD); SKIP lists outlines that are not towers (cwb-0418, cwb-0523). Each reason is in the tool and in the tower record."
