    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/common-crawl-index",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://data.commoncrawl.org/crawl-data/CC-MAIN-2026-39/cc-index-table.paths.gz, cc-index/table/cc-main/warc/crawl=CC-MAIN-2026-39/subset=warc/*.parquet, crawl-data/.../*.warc.gz",
     "dct:description": "HTTP range requests, one at a time, >= 1 s apart, up to 4 tries on 403/429/5xx (15, 45, 135 s)"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/social-feeds",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://<instance>/tags/<tag>.rss; https://public.api.bsky.app/xrpc/app.bsky.actor.searchActors; https://bsky.app/profile/<handle>/rss; https://feddit.uk/api/v3/search, /feeds/c/<name>.xml; https://groups.io/search?q=<term>",
     "dct:description": "GET; groups.io and Reddit feeds never fetched"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/feed-providers",
     "dcat:accessURL": "every candidate feed URL and every hand-listed or discovered home page",
     "dct:description": "robots.txt (RFC 9309) on every host and redirect; one request at a time per host >= 1 s apart; 8 hosts at once; 30 s timeout; up to 3 tries on 429/503; a second request with Origin https://danbri.github.io for CORS"
    }
   ],
   "prov:generated": [
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/discovery/candidates.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/discovery/london-feeds.opml"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/events.json"
    },
    {
     "cwp:pathPattern": "data/raw/feed-discovery/{seeds,cc-feeds,cc-footers-<crawl>,autodiscover,verify,robots}.json"
    }
   ],
   "cwp:tool": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/tools/discover-feeds.mjs"
   },
   "cwp:command": "NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY=1 node magpie/cwplans/tools/discover-feeds.mjs [seed|cc|autodiscover|verify|build] [--refresh] [--no-merge] (cc needs CC_LIBS=<dir with hyparquet>)",
   "cwp:kind": "fetch",
   "cwp:rule": [
    "Autodiscovery: <link rel=\"alternate\"> RSS, Atom and JSON Feed links (comment feeds dropped) and up to three .ics/webcal links; a hand-listed page with none is tried at /feed/, /rss.xml, /feed.xml, /rss, /news/rss/ until one parses; at most three feeds per page.",
    "Status: verified (parses with at least one item), empty, not a feed, http error, network error, blocked (Cloudflare, SiteGround, Imperva, Azure WAF pages), robots disallowed, robots unreachable (5xx or no answer = disallow), not fetched (terms). live = verified with an item dated within 365 days.",
    "Relevance, counts only: zone_items = items whose title, summary, content or categories name a zone place (Canary Wharf, Isle of Dogs, Docklands, Millwall, Cubitt Town, Blackwall, Poplar, Limehouse, Wapping, Shadwell, Rotherhithe, Surrey Quays, Canada Water, Deptford, Greenwich, Silvertown, Royal Docks and others) or district E14, SE16, SE10, SE8, E16, E1W; recent = dated within 120 days; score = 3 x zone_recent + zone + 5 x share. No item text stored; at most two titles cut to 80 characters, none for social, forum and mailing-list feeds.",
    "Duplicates: key = host without www + path without trailing slash + query; Blogger /atom.xml, /rss.xml and /feeds/posts/default are one feed; utm_ parameters dropped.",
    "Bluesky: a handle is kept only when it is a registrable domain under .gov.uk, .nhs.uk, .police.uk, .ac.uk, .sch.uk or .london, or the domain of a publisher already found (private people excluded). groups.io: London groups only (name or description places them in London); feeds not fetched (robots.txt). Reddit: not fetched (robots.txt Disallow: /).",
    "Common Crawl CC-MAIN-2026-39: hosts ending .london (all) and .uk hosts whose name holds a London place; sample by sha1(host): .london 200, zone places all (cap 500), boroughs 100, \"london\" 200; first capture with HTTP 200 and HTML; feeds kept when the page says London or has a London postcode (.london always).",
    "events.json merge: re-read before writing, append only, ids disc-<slug>, layout kept (2 spaces); a live candidate not already in events.json or feeds.json, with a zone item, a zone publisher, or a council or transport body; social only with zone items; harvest: false unless kind is events (tools/fetch-works.mjs harvests verified event feeds).",
    "Wikipedia: MediaWiki Action API used per its etiquette (descriptive User-Agent, one call at a time); its robots.txt Disallow: /w/ is for page crawlers and is not applied to API calls. Titles only (text is CC BY-SA).",
    "Excluded, never fetched: Facebook, Nextdoor, WhatsApp, X, Instagram, TikTok (no feed, terms forbid scraping), Google Groups (feeds removed), JISCMail (Cloudflare challenge), Meetup RSS (robots.txt), Eventbrite (token), Google News RSS (terms)."
   ],
   "cwp:network": true,
   "cwp:deterministic": false,
   "cwp:after": [
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#activity/crawl-sites"
    }
   ],
   "cwp:area": "feeds",
   "cwp:fault": [
    "F11"
   ],
   "cwp:judgement": "The hand lists (local news, community, councils, public bodies, hashtags, subreddits), the Feedspot slugs, the Common Crawl sample sizes, the kind of each seed and the events.json merge rule are hand decisions written in the tool; recorded in skills/cwplans-feed-discovery/SKILL.md."
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#activity/fetch-live",
   "@type": "prov:Activity",
   "rdfs:label": "fetch-live",
   "dct:description": "Fetches live and fast-changing state for the Docklands zone (the model box plus the east margin of fetch-works) and writes one dated snapshot per source with a common item shape {id, kind, name, zone, time, position, values, url}: Santander Cycles docks, TfL lift outages, live station busyness, JamCam cameras, UKPN power cuts, Thames Water storm overflows, NOTAMs (cranes and temporary areas) and the UK AIP helicopter structure (H4 and restricted areas).",
   "prov:used": [
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/tfl-live-feeds",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://api.tfl.gov.uk/BikePoint",
     "dct:description": "every dock, one request"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/tfl-live-feeds",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://api.tfl.gov.uk/Disruptions/Lifts/v2/",
     "dct:description": "every current lift outage, one request"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/tfl-live-feeds",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://api.tfl.gov.uk/StopPoint/Mode/tube,dlr,elizabeth-line,overground",
     "dct:description": "station positions, naptan and hub codes; cached (reused when present)"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/tfl-live-feeds",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://api.tfl.gov.uk/crowding/{naptan}/Live",
     "dct:description": "one request per Tube, DLR, Elizabeth line and Overground station naptan in the zone (65 on 2026-10-04)"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/tfl-live-feeds",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://api.tfl.gov.uk/Place/Type/JamCam",
     "dct:description": "every camera, one request"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/ukpn-live-faults",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://ukpowernetworks.opendatasoft.com/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/ukpn-live-faults/exports/json",
     "dct:description": "the whole dataset"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/thames-water-storm-overflows",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://services2.arcgis.com/g6o32ZDQ33GpCIu3/arcgis/rest/services/Thames_Water_Storm_Overflow_Activity_(Production)_view/FeatureServer/0/query",
     "dct:description": "envelope -0.095,51.474,0.085,51.522 (inSR 4326), outFields=*, returnGeometry=false"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/nats-pib",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://pibs.nats.co.uk/operational/pibs/PIB.xml",
     "dct:description": "the full UK PIB, one request"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://danbri.github.io/glitchcan-minigam/magpie/cwplans/data-register.json#source/nats-uk-aip",
     "dcat:accessURL": "https://www.aurora.nats.co.uk/htmlAIP/Publications/2024-03-21-AIRAC/html/eAIP/EG-AD-2.EGLL-en-GB.html and EG-ENR-5.1-en-GB.html",
     "dct:description": "two pages; cached (reused when present)"
    },
    {
     "@id": "urn:cwplans:local:data/raw/live/%20(raw%20responses;%20--no-fetch%20reads%20them)"
    }
   ],
   "prov:generated": [
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/bikes.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/lifts.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/crowding.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/jamcams.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/ukpn.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/overflows.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/notams.json"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/feeds/live/helicopters.json"
    }
   ],
   "cwp:tool": {
    "@id": "https://github.com/danbri/glitchcan-minigam/blob/master/magpie/cwplans/tools/fetch-live.mjs"
   },
   "cwp:command": "NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY=1 node magpie/cwplans/tools/fetch-live.mjs [bikes lifts crowding jamcams ukpn overflows notams helicopters] [--no-fetch]",
   "cwp:kind": "fetch",
   "cwp:rule": [
    "Zone: BOX_WGS84 of fetch-docklands.mjs (-0.095, 51.474, 0.015, 51.522) = 'model'; 0.015 to 0.085 E, 51.495 to 51.522 N = 'east'; items outside are dropped, except context items in helicopters.json (zone null).",
    "Bikes: values as published (NbBikes, NbStandardBikes, NbEBikes, NbEmptyDocks, NbDocks; Installed, Locked, Temporary); unavailable_docks = NbDocks - NbBikes - NbEmptyDocks; time = the newest property 'modified'.",
    "Lifts: stationUniqueId matched to StopPoint naptanId, then hubNaptanCode; kept when the station is in the zone; message kept as published.",
    "Crowding: Tube and DLR (940GZZLU, 940GZZDL) then 910G station naptans in the zone, one at a time; percentageOfBaseline rounded to 0.001; dataAvailable false and 404 counted, not listed.",
    "JamCams: position, view, available, imageUrl and videoUrl recorded; no image fetched or stored.",
    "UKPN: kept when geopoint is in the zone; fullpostcodedata, mainmessage, plannedincidentreason and incidentcategorycustomerfriendlydescription dropped.",
    "Storm overflows: Status 1 discharging (indicated, not confirmed), 0 not, -1 monitor offline; epoch milliseconds to UTC ISO.",
    "NOTAMs: kept when a position stated in item E (DDMMSS(.s)N DDDMMSS(.s)E/W) lies in the zone, or item E states none and the Q-line centre does with a radius of at most 5 NM; deduplicated by series/number/year; kept: Q-code, FIR, item A, validity (PERM kept as text), lower/upper FL, Q radius, item E positions and 'n FT AGL / m FT AMSL' heights, area vertices for 'BOUNDED BY', the first bracketed place label; dropped: item E text, phone numbers, contacts.",
    "Helicopters: H4 rows of EGLL AD 2.22 para 12 (the table anchored on 'Isle-of-Dogs'): reporting type (compulsory or on request), name, OS grid reference, position, description cut to 120 characters; the H4 vertical profile as printed; ENR 5.1 EGR158, EGR159, EGR160: vertices, arc centres and radii, upper limit, permitted users, SI; an area is in the zone when its vertex centroid or a vertex is.",
    "Network: User-Agent glitchcan-cwplans/0.1; one request at a time per host, at least 1.5 s apart; up to 5 tries with Retry-After or a doubling pause on 429, 5xx, timeouts and resets; 404 returned without retry; files overwritten on every run."
   ],
   "cwp:network": true,
   "cwp:deterministic": false,
   "cwp:after": [],
   "cwp:area": "feeds",
   "cwp:fault": [],
   "cwp:judgement": "Which sources are open enough to commit (TfL terms, CC BY 4.0) and which only as facts (NATS PIB, UK AIP) or not at all (CAA CAP 1455; OpenSky, adsb.fi, airplanes.live, ADS-B Exchange; adsb.lol as ODbL without the owner's agreement) is recorded in data-register.json sources, feeds/live/README.md and the skill cwplans-live-state."
  },
