   "dct:description": "Fetches dated snapshots of the river, docks, locks, water quality, moorings and boats in the Docklands zone (the 3D model box, the Royal Docks margin and a strip north to Bow Locks) and writes one JSON file per source: {meta: source, url, fetched, licence, attribution, method, counts, zone; items: id, kind, time or validity, position {lat, lon, precision, zone}, values, url}.",
