   "cwp:osmUse": "derived",
   "cwp:review": "occupants include CWG page links, mall names and levels from cwg-directory.json; 106 occupants come from the CWG directory alone, placed by street address, mall host outline or postcode with a confidence; cwg_unplaced lists the entries with no building and why. Business phone and email from OSM are kept under the cwplans exception (owner, 2026-10-03). Register links keep the key (UPRN, register point, mall, street address, name, postcode), its precision and a confidence; registers_unplaced and registers_uprn_rejected list what was not placed and why. Charity contact addresses are placed only by UPRN or a non-residential building (owner, 2026-10-03)"
  },
